        "heading": "Computer Vision Model Training",
        "body": "Computer vision model training allows a model to learn visual patterns from prepared data.\n\nA training workflow can include:\n\nFor dedicated model-development and optimisation work, explore our [AI Model Training & Optimisation Services](/machine-learning-ml/model-training-optimization).",
