        "body": "Choosing between native and cross-platform development should happen before development begins.\n\nCross-platform development is often suitable when businesses want both Android and iOS applications with similar functionality.\n\nNative development can be more appropriate where the product depends heavily on platform-specific capabilities.\n\nIf native development is the better choice, we also provide dedicated [iOS app development](/mobile-development/ios-app-development) and [Android app development](/mobile-development/android-app-development) services.",
