        "body": "Structured video metadata can make recorded footage easier to search.\n\nInstead of manually reviewing long recordings, a system can index events according to attributes such as:\n\nA workflow can look like:\n\nRecorded Video → Analytics → Event Metadata → Search Index → Matching Video Segment",
